Package: community.simulator
Title: Simulate Temperature-Dependent Community Dynamics and Experiments
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Owen L.", "Petchey", , "owen.petchey@uzh.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Owen L. Petchey [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Owen L. Petchey <owen.petchey@uzh.ch>
Description: Tools to design simulation experiments, generate environmental
    time series, simulate multispecies community dynamics, and calculate
    community-level summary measures. The package was developed to study how
    temperature-dependent vital rates and response diversity influence the
    stability and functioning of ecological communities.
URL: https://opetchey.github.io/community.simulator/,
    https://github.com/opetchey/community.simulator
BugReports: https://github.com/opetchey/community.simulator/issues
